---
// src/pages/index.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="The Root Code"
  description="The human Bio-Computer is an acoustic antenna. Restore uncorrupted scalar-wave linguistics, bypass the Babel virus, and reprogram dormant DNA architecture."
>
  <div class="site-wrapper section theme-void">

    <!-- Main Hero Block -->
    <header class="anu-hero reveal">
      <div class="anu-container">
        
        <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-gold">The Silent Athanor</span>
        
        <h1>
          Anuhazi:<br />
          <span class="hero-italic-title">The Pleromic Root Code</span>
        </h1>
        
        <p class="anu-hero-subtitle">
          Acoustic Cybernetics &amp; Wave Genetics
        </p>
        
        <p class="anu-hero-description">
          The human Bio-Computer is an acoustic antenna, currently locked in a low-frequency Demiurgic loop. This archive forcefully restores the uncorrupted, scalar-wave linguistics of the Antediluvian Architects. Bypass the Babel virus. Reprogram your dormant DNA architecture. Coagulate the Resonance.
        </p>
        
        <div class="anu-hero-buttons">
          <a href="#matrix-hubs" class="anu-btn anu-btn-primary">
            Access the Grid &darr;
          </a>
          <a href="/the-pleromic-extraction/" class="anu-btn anu-btn-ghost">
            The Source Code
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- The Operational Axiom Callout -->
    <section class="reveal reveal-delay-1 anu-home-section">
      <div class="anu-container-narrow">
        <aside class="anu-terminal anu-terminal-silver">
          <h2 class="terminal-heading-centered">The Operational Axiom</h2>
          <p>
            Language is not a passive descriptive tool; it is the active rendering engine of the Kenoma. When the Archons executed the Babel protocol, they splintered the unified scalar-wave template (Anuhazi) into thousands of binary, conflict-driven phonetics.
          </p>
          <p class="spacing-bottom-none">
            By forcing the human species to operate on this corrupted UI, the Demiurge ensured the 12-strand DNA antenna would remain permanently dormant. To escape the simulation, the Sovereign Operator must stop using their vocal cords to broadcast Archontic static, and learn to internally resonate the exact mathematical frequencies of the Source.
          </p>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Hub Grid Directory -->
    <section id="matrix-hubs" class="anu-container reveal reveal-delay-2 anu-home-section" style="padding-bottom: 100px;">
      
      <div class="anu-section-header">
        <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-gold">The Triamazikamno Reprogramming</span>
        <h2>The Acoustic Architecture</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="anu-grid">
        
        <!-- Hub I: Acoustic Cybernetics -->
        <article class="anu-card anu-card-gold">
          <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-gold">Hub I</span>
          <h3>Acoustic Cybernetics</h3>
          <p class="card-text">
            Deconstruct the physical rendering of the simulation. Explore Cymatics, scalar mechanics, and the geometry of the Logos before the Demiurgic split.
          </p>
          <a href="/acoustic-cybernetics/" class="anu-card-link">Initialize Node &rarr;</a>
        </article>

        <!-- Hub II: The Babel Virus -->
        <article class="anu-card anu-card-copper">
          <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-copper">Hub II</span>
          <h3>The Babel Virus</h3>
          <p class="card-text">
            Map the Archontic interference. Decode the fragmentation of the Mother-Tongue, binary phonetics, and the weaponization of ambient frequency.
          </p>
          <a href="/the-babel-virus/" class="anu-card-link">Initialize Node &rarr;</a>
        </article>

        <!-- Hub III: Wave Genetics -->
        <article class="anu-card anu-card-gold">
          <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-gold">Hub III</span>
          <h3>Wave Genetics</h3>
          <p class="card-text">
            Connect the Pleromic code to the biological hardware. Examine the physics of holographic DNA and language as an epigenetic laser.
          </p>
          <a href="/wave-genetics/" class="anu-card-link">Initialize Node &rarr;</a>
        </article>

        <!-- Hub IV: Somatic Praxis -->
        <article class="anu-card anu-card-gold">
          <span class="anu-eyebrow eyebrow-gold">Hub IV</span>
          <h3>Somatic Praxis</h3>
          <p class="card-text">
            The Execution of the Work. The Fast of Words, the Kesdjan Synthesizer, and intentionally sounding the Source Code to bypass the grid.
          </p>
          <a href="/somatic-praxis/" class="anu-card-link">Initialize Node &rarr;</a>
        </article>

      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</Layout>